Implemented the dashboard expansion and documented the work in [CODEX-DASHBOARD2-REPORT.md](</Users/maged/Desktop/new/website data/new site/_project/CODEX-DASHBOARD2-REPORT.md>).

Verification:

- Dashboard smoke test: passed all 15 sections.
- `/dashboard/`: HTTP 200.
- Build: 346 pages generated.
- Validator: blocked by 7 errors from the parallel agent’s generated `site/google-test.html`.
